---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, MAILING_ADDRESS } from '../consts';
---
<PageLayout
  title="Contact"
  heading="Contact"
  intro="The way to reach Thinker's Foundation is by email.">
  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p><a class="link" href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a></p>
    <p>A person reads it. Other role addresses at this domain, such as <code>info@</code>, <code>security@</code> and <code>abuse@</code>, reach the same person.</p>
    <h2>Postal address</h2>
    {MAILING_ADDRESS
      ? <address>{MAILING_ADDRESS.map((l) => <span>{l}<br /></span>)}</address>
      : <p>A postal address will be published here when the organization has one to publish. Until then, email is the way.</p>}
    <h2>Security and abuse reports</h2>
    <p>Write to <a class="link" href="mailto:security@thinkersfoundation.net">security@thinkersfoundation.net</a> for a vulnerability in anything we publish, or <a class="link" href="mailto:abuse@thinkersfoundation.net">abuse@thinkersfoundation.net</a> for misuse of anything we publish.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
<style>
  .prose{max-width:66ch}
  .prose h2{font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,28px);margin:36px 0 4px}
  .prose h2:first-of-type{margin-top:8px}
  .prose p,.prose address{color:var(--muted);font-size:17px;margin:14px 0 0;font-style:normal}
  code{font-family:ui-monospace,Consolas,monospace;font-size:.92em;color:var(--text)}
</style>
